   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Regular formation: stem + vowel e",
     "texto": [
      "Konjunktiv I is formed by adding to the infinitive stem the specific endings: **-e, -est, -e, -en, -et, -en**. In journalistic practice it is seen above all in the third person singular (**er/sie arbeite, führe, bestehe, melde**), since it is clearly distinct from the present indicative (**er arbeitet, führt, besteht**).",
      "When a form of Konjunktiv I coincides completely with the indicative (which almost always happens with **wir** and **sie** in regular verbs), Konjunktiv II or **würde + infinitive** is used."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "tabla",
     "titulo": "Verb",
     "columnas": [
